{"seq":2,"slug":"tax-incidence","title":"大学财政学 — 税收归宿","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/public-finance/government-revenue/tax-incidence","wordCount":1632,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学财政学-税收归宿\">大学财政学 — 税收归宿</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>税收归宿（tax incidence）研究的是一个看似简单、实则极其反直觉的问题：一项税，最终究竟由谁承担？法律规定向谁征税（法定归宿）和实际上谁的福利受损（经济归宿），常常是两回事。这是整门财政学中最重要、也最容易被误解的概念。</p>\n<p>举个例子：政府向企业征收一笔工资税，名义上由企业缴纳。但企业可能通过压低工资把税负转嫁给员工，或通过涨价转嫁给消费者。所以&quot;向企业征税&quot;不等于&quot;企业承担税负&quot;。理解税收归宿的核心洞见是：<strong>税负的实际分配由供给和需求的相对弹性决定，与法律规定谁交税无关</strong>。谁更难改变行为（弹性更小），谁就承担更多税负。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"法定归宿-vs-经济归宿\">法定归宿 vs 经济归宿</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>法定归宿</strong>（statutory incidence）：法律规定谁有义务把税款交给政府。</li>\n<li><strong>经济归宿</strong>（economic incidence）：税收实际导致谁的真实收入下降。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者分离的原因是&quot;税负转嫁&quot;——交税的一方可以通过调整价格，把负担推给交易的另一方。一个著名结论是<strong>归宿等价性</strong>：无论法律规定向买方征税还是向卖方征税，最终的经济归宿完全相同。向消费者征 1 元税，和向商家征 1 元税，市场出清后买卖双方各自承担的份额是一样的。这是税收归宿理论最违反直觉、却最坚实的结论。</p>\n<h3 id=\"弹性决定归宿\">弹性决定归宿</h3><p>谁承担更多税负，取决于供求双方谁的弹性更小（更&quot;刚需&quot;、更难替代）。基本规律：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>消费者承担的税负</mtext><mtext>生产者承担的税负</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{消费者承担的税负}}{\\text{生产者承担的税负}} = \\frac{E_s}{E_d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">生产者承担的税负</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">消费者承担的税负</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为供给弹性，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为需求弹性（取绝对值）。直觉是：弹性小的一方&quot;逃不掉&quot;，只能承担更多税。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>谁的弹性小</th>\n<th>谁承担更多税负</th>\n<th>现实例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>需求缺乏弹性</td>\n<td>消费者</td>\n<td>消费者</td>\n<td>香烟税：烟民难戒，税负主要落在烟民身上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供给缺乏弹性</td>\n<td>生产者</td>\n<td>生产者</td>\n<td>土地税：土地供给固定，地主承担</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求富有弹性</td>\n<td>生产者承担更多</td>\n<td>生产者</td>\n<td>奢侈品税：买家易放弃，卖家被迫降价吸收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这解释了一个常见的政策现象：政府提高烟草税，目的之一是减少吸烟，但由于烟草需求缺乏弹性，实际效果是烟民承担了大部分税负，吸烟量下降有限，政府税收反而显著增加。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用供求图理解归宿\">用供求图理解归宿</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[对商品征收单位税 t] --&gt; B[供给曲线上移 t]&#10;    B --&gt; C[新均衡: 消费者付价上升, 生产者得价下降]&#10;    C --&gt; D{弹性比较}&#10;    D --&gt;|需求更陡 缺乏弹性| E[消费者承担更多]&#10;    D --&gt;|供给更陡 缺乏弹性| F[生产者承担更多]\">graph TD\n    A[对商品征收单位税 t] --&gt; B[供给曲线上移 t]\n    B --&gt; C[新均衡: 消费者付价上升, 生产者得价下降]\n    C --&gt; D{弹性比较}\n    D --&gt;|需求更陡 缺乏弹性| E[消费者承担更多]\n    D --&gt;|供给更陡 缺乏弹性| F[生产者承担更多]</pre><p>设征税前价格为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。征收单位税 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 后，消费者支付价格升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，生产者实得价格降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_c - P_p = t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。消费者承担 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_c - P_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，生产者承担 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_0 - P_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，两者之和等于税额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。曲线越陡（越缺乏弹性）的一方，价格变动越大，承担的税负份额越高。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个经典案例-1990-年美国奢侈品税\">一个经典案例：1990 年美国奢侈品税</h3><p>1990 年，美国国会为向富人征税，对游艇、私人飞机、珠宝等奢侈品开征 10% 的奢侈品税。立法者以为税负会落在富有的买家身上。结果呢？富人需求富有弹性——他们干脆不买，或去国外购买。游艇销量暴跌，承担税负的反而是造船厂的蓝领工人（大量失业）和经销商。这项税不仅没收到多少钱，还摧毁了一个行业，于 1993 年被废除。这是税收归宿理论在现实中最生动的教训：<strong>想向某人征税，未必征得到。</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"工资税归宿与-雇主缴费-的幻觉\">工资税归宿与&quot;雇主缴费&quot;的幻觉</h3><p>社会保险中，养老保险等常由&quot;雇主缴一半、雇员缴一半&quot;。许多人以为这意味着雇主真的承担了一半负担。但经济学研究普遍发现：由于劳动供给相对缺乏弹性（人们不会因为工资略降就大量退出劳动力市场），名义上由雇主缴纳的部分，很大程度上通过压低工资转嫁给了雇员。换句话说，&quot;雇主缴费&quot;在很大程度上是一种会计幻觉，实际税负主要由劳动者承担。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>区分&quot;法定归宿&quot;和&quot;经济归宿&quot;，并解释为什么二者常常分离。</li>\n<li>&quot;归宿等价性&quot;是什么意思？为什么向买方征税和向卖方征税的最终结果相同？这对&quot;该向谁征税才公平&quot;的争论有何启示？</li>\n<li>用弹性比值公式解释：为什么提高香烟税，税负主要由烟民承担，而吸烟量下降有限？</li>\n<li>复盘 1990 年美国奢侈品税的失败。为什么针对富人的税最终伤害了工人？这说明了什么道理？</li>\n<li>有人说&quot;养老保险雇主缴一半，所以企业承担了一半成本&quot;。请用税收归宿理论评价这一说法。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Harvey Rosen &amp; Ted Gayer,《Public Finance》税收归宿章节——标准教材的权威讲解</li>\n<li>现实连接：搜索&quot;1990 美国奢侈品税 游艇&quot;，阅读这一政策失败的真实报道。</li>\n<li>现实连接：了解中国社会保险的缴费比例，结合本节理论思考&quot;雇主缴费&quot;实际由谁承担。</li>\n<li>Jonathan Gruber,《Public Finance and Public Policy》——含大量税收归宿的实证研究。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>税收归宿是财政学最反直觉的核心概念：法定归宿（谁交税）与经济归宿（谁真正承担）常常分离，原因是税负可以通过价格调整转嫁。归宿等价性表明，向买方或卖方征税的最终结果相同。真正决定税负分配的是供求弹性——弹性小的一方&quot;逃不掉&quot;，承担更多，比值由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_s / E_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 给出。香烟税落在烟民身上、土地税落在地主身上、1990 年奢侈品税意外伤害工人、工资税实际由劳动者承担，都是这一理论的生动印证。带走的核心信条是：想向某人征税，未必征得到——政策制定者必须分析归宿，而非想当然。下一节我们将逐一拆解中国的主要税种。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学财政学 — 税收归宿","id":"大学财政学-税收归宿"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"法定归宿 vs 经济归宿","id":"法定归宿-vs-经济归宿"},{"level":3,"text":"弹性决定归宿","id":"弹性决定归宿"},{"level":3,"text":"用供求图理解归宿","id":"用供求图理解归宿"},{"level":3,"text":"一个经典案例：1990 年美国奢侈品税","id":"一个经典案例-1990-年美国奢侈品税"},{"level":3,"text":"工资税归宿与\"雇主缴费\"的幻觉","id":"工资税归宿与-雇主缴费-的幻觉"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学财政学 — 税收原则与税制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/public-finance/government-revenue/taxation-principles"},"next":{"title":"大学财政学 — 主要税种解析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/public-finance/government-revenue/major-tax-types"}}